# Base URL of the SriDha Academy API.
# - Local development: /api (the Vite dev server proxies /api to http://localhost:4000)
# - Production on Cloudflare Pages: set to your deployed API origin (e.g. https://api.yourdomain.com/api),
#   or /api if serving both behind a reverse proxy / Cloudflare route on the same origin.
VITE_API_URL=/api

# Sentry project DSN for browser errors (a separate Sentry project from the
# API is clearest). Read at build time: set it in Cloudflare Pages and
# redeploy. Leave unset to send nothing; Sentry is then not even downloaded.
# VITE_SENTRY_DSN=
